                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "c6735bc0-065c-3d6c-9bb0-4213d458417f",
                        "entry_id": "0b0f5274-3e6f-3e16-a00c-c5a39c487f7f",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Circumcision."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "informal"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "5e47a314-4b44-499b-b9fb-81d6d3ba6a80",
                                "sense_id": "c6735bc0-065c-3d6c-9bb0-4213d458417f",
                                "text": "During the pre-NHS 1930s, circumcision was as fashionable among the British middle class as confirmation. Breech deliveries were said to be popular with both obstetrician and anaesthetist, a boy assuring them early in the birth of 'a couple of guineas next week for the circ.'"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "6a664d3d-9309-425d-abd8-dc7d2d8ffa43",
                                "sense_id": "c6735bc0-065c-3d6c-9bb0-4213d458417f",
                                "text": "The circ is progressing apace when, without warning, one of the nurses bursts in from outside, and I mean bursts in, as opposed to entering soundlessly and unobtrusively as we all try to (with the exception of the attending surgeons, who always burst in), and tells us, \"Someone just crashed a plane into one of the Twin Towers.\""
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a6ad27b7-c3ba-4d22-b096-a6b08a12e95f",
                                "sense_id": "c6735bc0-065c-3d6c-9bb0-4213d458417f",
                                "text": "Ironically, our Japanese-born colleague Seiji, who came from a culture that did not circumcise, had no problem with it. In fact, he was amazing to behold. Seiji could finish a \"slice and dice,\" as we called it, before I could even get my gloves on. Bob and I would change every poopy, slimy diaper in that nursery just to stall until Seiji finished the circs."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [],
                "word_linkages": []
            },
